(This report records the second full walk of the Cinder Peak treeline transect, a fixed line) Tj
T*
(of thirty-six plots that the Meridian Gazette environment desk has followed since the) Tj
T*
(transect was established. Every station is revisited twice a season, at the opening of the) Tj
T*
(melt and again at its close, and each is reported below in the same order and the same) Tj
T*
(shape: position, stand age from the oldest cored stem, stem density over the fixed plot,) Tj
T*
(canopy closure, and any damage found. Nothing in this report is interpolated - a station) Tj
T*
(with no reading is reported as having none.) Tj
T*
ET

