(Across the full transect the season's clearest pattern was that canopy closure fell with) Tj
T*
(elevation while stand age did not, which the desk reads as recruitment failing at the upper) Tj
T*
(stations rather than the older stands there dying back. The transect will be walked again) Tj
T*
(next season on the same schedule.) Tj
T*
